{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：16:16 2026-05-09 HKT<br/>發佈時間：16:16 2026-05-09 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：16:16 2026-05-09 HKT</p><img alt=\"「金鑽精靈」捧盃慶節\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl_square/4c149c669439e4edd166fdbb47c90be3/2026-05/r7_0.jpg\"/><p>騎師希威森的母親和胞姊日前到港，主要為希望團聚和慶祝母親節，他在陣上自然全力以赴，結果在第七場策騎「金鑽精靈」爆岀十三倍冷門贏馬，此駒上場在五班賽贏馬，今日升班再跑同程，改以前領方法發揮，順利再贏一場。</p><h2>按下圖睇更多相片：</h2><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/ed03c3624e0364a82fb27762f5715d52/2026-05/7a929185-6cef-4ff4-a478-d126f0399fc0.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/98be423776a23e8292f0d6283e7b7e93/2026-05/7ca7d374-da27-4843-aa9a-b987fd5c7753.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/07b5505b518dcf361fc3d1857981c453/2026-05/809d4d4e-6f20-4ddf-86e1-393508e4a791.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/1a80ec919f05391fda4574dbc00287cd/2026-05/2461cb76-f8a9-430d-a985-0d1974fa7a53.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/c19ac3dd560b07b5f99d50f1c5fc0c2c/2026-05/5214a5a4-4186-44ad-a288-017c46593989.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/b78ccae96626dbc1a77a455f97f9da3c/2026-05/9778e1a8-2978-49dc-b9d4-7ecf731e5425.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/d160493f8fcf994695fcf8fc420ebe61/2026-05/793580ab-1b4e-4a4b-a6bb-e715e9d95fe3.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/b01e7ef4e7e29a2499fc77f96d9933c6/2026-05/58366369-358d-4646-8347-89c14e3ebd43.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/504b4efad7267e9781e7f0d5c7941117/2026-05/be62e067-b57d-4c4c-9b57-27bb2c8e1192.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/6c094b37900d65f5184aee9ba8b2ce48/2026-05/d9c449ea-4c78-4525-993d-453e97c5592d.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/2c31ed7e9c1cea08e1045c49f0c64072/2026-05/d22c7aaa-2bec-47ac-bb4c-80a5b981e68c.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/0207ad54b29d40b59ec59cfb